https://doi.org/10.13140/RG.2.2.31848.70401
93 Means, B., Bakia, M., & Murphy, R. (2014). Learning online: What research tells us about whether, when and how. 
Routledge.
94 Wiggins, G., & McTighe, J. (1998). What is backward design. In Understanding by design (pp. 7–19).
https://educationaltechnology.net/wp-content/uploads/2016/01/backward-design.pdf
